Subject: [PATCH] aarch64: add opt-in Qualcomm download-mode cookie clear

Add a qcom-dload-mode-clear kernel feature, disabled by default. When enabled,
check the device tree SCM node and firmware call availability, then clear the
Qualcomm download-mode cookie before either AArch64 reset entrypoint.

